      "fix": "Match the whole metadata block rather than one line \u2014 e.g. `grep -rn '\\${{' .github/actions --include=action.yml` filtered to lines outside the `runs:`/`outputs[].value` sections, or parse each action.yml with yq/python and assert no `${{` appears in `name`, `author`, `description`, or any `inputs.*.description`.",
      "line": 165,
      "ordinal": 1,
      "severity": "P3",
      "since_round": 1,
      "status": "open",
      "title": "Guard misses folded descriptions and other template fields"
